    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... i don't want to be \"rediscovered.\" i dont want to spend the next ten years trying to scrape together some version of myself that isn't a disappointment. it feels like i've already seen how the movie ends. wouldn't it be better if they just remembered me as the person who actually made it? instead of watching me slowly fall apart and become someone they don't recognize?",
